              <a href="/tutorials/" class="cc-top-link"><span class="cc-top-icon"><svg class="cc-nav-svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 5.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 6.5 3H11v17H6.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 0 4 22V5.5Z"/><path d="M20 5.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 0 17.5 3H13v17h4.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 20 22V5.5Z"/></svg></span> Tutorials</a>
              <a href="/programs/" class="cc-top-link"><span class="cc-top-icon"><svg class="cc-nav-svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 4C6.3 4 6 5.3 6 7v3c0 1.5-.5 2-2 2 1.5 0 2 .5 2 2v3c0 1.7.3 3 2 3M16 4c1.7 0 2 1.3 2 3v3c0 1.5.5 2 2 2-1.5 0-2 .5-2 2v3c0 1.7-.3 3-2 3"/></svg></span> Programs</a>
              <a href="/interview-questions/" class="cc-top-link"><span class="cc-top-icon"><svg class="cc-nav-svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="4" y="3" width="16" height="18" rx="2"/><path d="M8 8h8M8 12h8M8 16h5"/></svg></span> Interview Questions</a>
